set moves to a list of "rock", "paper" and "scissors"
ask "Rock, paper or scissors?" and call it mine
set theirs to a random item from moves
show "I picked {theirs}."
if mine is theirs
    show "A draw!"
otherwise if mine is "rock" and theirs is "scissors" or "lizard"
    show "You win!"
otherwise
    show "Good game."
